Recommends: qt6-translations-l10n
Description: unofficial Qt6 GUI for zapret2
 Graphical front-end for zapret2 (bol-van): service and configuration management,
 profile and user hostlist editing, journal monitoring, DPI bypass strategy
 selection (blockcheck2), system tray applet, autostart, and installation/update
 of zapret2 from the latest GitHub release. Privileged operations go through a
 small polkit-protected helper. zapret2 itself is not bundled.
